# 1. Ignore everything across the workspace by default
*

# 2. Allow Git to traverse directory structures
!*/

# 3. Whitelist repository control & UE5 project files
!.gitignore
!*.uproject

# 4. Whitelist C++ source files, headers, and C# build rules
!Source/
!Source/**

# 5. Whitelist module configurations and Gameplay Tag INIs
!Config/
!Config/**

# 6. Exclude generated compilation folders inside Source
Source/**/Intermediate/
Source/**/Binaries/